This licence covers the code and the aggregate measurements in `results/`.
It does not cover third-party data, which is not redistributed here:

- FLORES+ (openlanguagedata/flores_plus) is CC BY-SA 4.0 and gated. The
  derived condition files are excluded by .gitignore; `run_all.py --stage
  conditions` rebuilds them from the source.
- SIB-200 (Davlan/sib200) is CC BY-SA 4.0.
- PuMVR (github.com/prabhjotschugh/Not-Truly-Multilingual-PuMVR) carries no
  licence file. It is fetched at a pinned commit for evaluation only, never
  redistributed, and excluded by .gitignore.
